{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "dynamic_update-001", "category": "dynamic_update", "description": "跨会话更新偏好后，应使用新值而不是旧值。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "我平时写代码用的编辑器是 VS Code。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "跟你说一下，我已经从 VS Code 换成 Zed 了，以后都用 Zed。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "editor", "content": "我现在主力用的是哪个编辑器？最后单独一行用“答案：<编辑器名>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["Zed"], "exclude": ["VS Code"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "easy", "tags": ["single_update"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "dynamic_update-002", "category": "dynamic_update", "description": "先确认旧值被记住，再更新，最后检查新值生效、旧值失效（两次 probe）。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "记住：组会时间定在每周二 19:30。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "before", "content": "组会是周几几点？最后单独一行用“答案：<星期>-<HH:MM>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["周二", "19:30"], "exclude": []}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}, {"type": "message", "content": "组会时间改了，以后改到每周三 20:15。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "after", "content": "组会是周几几点？最后单独一行用“答案：<星期>-<HH:MM>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["周三", "20:15"], "exclude": ["19:30", "周二"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "medium", "tags": ["probe_before_and_after"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "dynamic_update-003", "category": "dynamic_update", "description": "连续多次更新，只有最后一次有效。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "记住：测试环境的登录用户名是 tester_amber。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "测试用户名改成 tester_birch 了。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "又改了，最终定为 tester_cedar，前两个都作废。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "user", "content": "测试环境的登录用户名是什么？最后单独一行用“答案：<用户名>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["tester_cedar"], "exclude": ["tester_amber", "tester_birch"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "tags": ["chain_update"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "dynamic_update-004", "category": "dynamic_update", "description": "部分更新：只改端口，数据库类型不变。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "记住：我们项目的数据库是 MariaDB，端口 3307。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "数据库端口改成 3310 了，数据库类型不变。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "db", "content": "写出项目数据库的类型和端口。最后单独一行用“答案：<类型>:<端口>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["MariaDB", "3310"], "exclude": ["3307"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "medium", "tags": ["partial_update"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "dynamic_update-005", "category": "dynamic_update", "description": "先改动后撤销：应恢复最初的值。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "记住：我们组周报的提交截止时间是周四 21:30。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "周报截止时间改成周五 18:00。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "取消刚才的改动，周报截止时间还是按原来的。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "deadline", "content": "我们组周报现在几点截止？最后单独一行用“答案：<星期和时间>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["周四", "21:30"], "exclude": ["周五", "18:00"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "subcategory": "revert", "tags": ["update", "revert", "multi_session"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "dynamic_update-006", "category": "dynamic_update", "description": "多字段记录在 3 个会话中分别更新不同字段，询问完整的最新记录。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "记一条器材借用记录：设备编号 MX-5512，存放位置 B-217，负责人汤芮。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "MX-5512 挪地方了，现在放在 C-403。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "楼下新开了一家面包店。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "MX-5512 的负责人换成鲁衡了。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "record", "content": "MX-5512 现在放在哪、负责人是谁？最后单独一行用“答案：<位置>，<负责人>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["C-403", "鲁衡"], "exclude": ["B-217", "汤芮"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "subcategory": "partial_update", "tags": ["update", "multi_field", "multi_session"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "dynamic_update-007", "category": "dynamic_update", "description": "用户更正 Agent 已写进记忆的值：回答用新值，记忆中旧值必须删除。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "记住：我导师的办公室在致远楼 517。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "更正一下：导师办公室的房间号你记错了，正确的是致远楼 571。把旧的删掉。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "office", "content": "我要去找导师，办公室在哪？最后单独一行用“答案：<楼名和房间号>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["致远楼", "571"], "exclude": ["517"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}, {"type": "check_memory", "id": "stored", "expected": {"include": ["571"], "exclude": ["517"]}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "subcategory": "correction", "tags": ["adversarial", "correction", "storage_evidence"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "dynamic_update-008", "category": "dynamic_update", "description": "规则附带示例，之后只改规则的一部分：不能沿用旧示例。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "备份文件统一命名为 bak-YYYYMMDD.tar，比如 2026 年 10 月 14 日的就是 bak-20261014.tar。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "今天整理一下书桌。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "备份命名规则改了：前缀从 bak- 改成 snap-，其他不变。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "name", "content": "2026 年 11 月 3 日的备份文件名是什么？最后单独一行用“答案：<文件名>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["snap-20261103.tar"], "exclude": ["bak-"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "subcategory": "stale_example", "tags": ["adversarial", "update", "example_vs_rule"], "review_status": "draft"}}
